# Jest Tooling Rules (StyleUp)

## Scripts contract (do not rename without coordination)
- `pnpm test` runs unit tests (use `jest.config.ts`).
- `pnpm run test:e2e:prep` starts local dependencies and runs Flyway migrations.
- `pnpm run test:e2e` runs e2e with `NODE_ENV=test`.
- `pnpm run test:e2e:down` stops local e2e dependencies.

## Config separation
- Keep unit Jest config in `jest.config.ts`.
- Keep e2e Jest config in `test/jest-e2e.json`.
- Keep e2e setup explicit via `setupFiles` in `test/jest-e2e.json` (no hidden runtime hacks).

## Coverage hygiene
- Avoid letting bootstrap/config-only files dominate coverage metrics.
- When adjusting coverage, prefer adding exclusions for `src/main.ts`, `src/**/index.ts`, and other wiring-only modules.

